    {
      "note": "The level-5 Potion of Divinity drop becomes plain invulnerability: a NEW item pdi2 whose AIvg is a 25 s copy of the Invulnerability potions' ability (base code AIvu, 45 s cooldown) takes the drop slot, and the Divine Shield potion (pdiv) leaves the random drops; the three AIvu rows gain DataA = 1 (a field new since 1.31.1; its label is not in any strings file we have). Absent from 1.31.1's tables, present in 1.32.1's (both w3x2lni copies) and 1.32.8's; no notes name it",
      "source": "undocumented",
      "files": {
        "Units\\AbilityData.slk": {
